note: review/codex_surface.py is run by hand: asks the local `codex` binary what it offers (D-209): the comparison's Codex column is a statement about that binary, and CI has no Codex to ask
note: review/comparison_sources.py is run by hand: re-derives the comparison's Pi and Hermes halves from their upstream READMEs, docs index, file tree and docs page (D-209): it needs the network
